Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:11.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快踩油门！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:16.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快报警 我要求……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.37,0:00:20.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 犯人劫持了巴士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:23.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他要求把你带过去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:27.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:30.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我必须去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:40.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是现场记者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:46.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前在葛南隧道内被劫持的巴士正与警方……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:53.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 一有危险就立刻逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:57.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:02.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,劫持巴士的犯人 似乎和我过去的某件事有关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.05,0:01:05.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到底是什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:08.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么想也想不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.79,0:01:11.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且只要一去想……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.70,0:01:19.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来电 未显示号码
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.59,0:01:21.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.18,0:01:28.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能不能稍后再打过来？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:33.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想告诉你一件有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.95,0:01:38.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.11,0:01:40.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,此前犯下多起袭击案的池内和哉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:43.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,目前正劫持多名人质
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:50.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,池内要求警方把一个叫田中爱之助的男孩带过去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:54.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们只能等了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:01.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:04.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:08.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你马上就要出狱了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:10.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:14.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:18.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你在里面表现很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:19.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这个嘛……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:24.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你应该想尽快找到你弟弟吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:27.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你知道他的下落？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.41,0:02:33.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果做DNA鉴定
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:37.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就会发现这把雕刻刀上的血迹是你弟弟的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.21,0:02:41.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他很可能就是被这把雕刻刀杀死的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:43.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被杀？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:45.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,想知道更多的话——
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:49.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,去问这个男孩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:51.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,1年3班 田中爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:06.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这就是田中爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.03,0:03:09.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚刚有一名学生抵达了现场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:10.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,重复一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.49,0:03:14.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刚刚有一名学生抵达了现场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:16.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢你赶过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:19.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们会全力支援你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.41,0:03:23.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以拜托你去见犯人 \N打探出他的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:31.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.75,0:03:45.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 小心点！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.73,0:03:58.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:06.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们退后！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:26.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,闭嘴！不准哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:37.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绑匪的要求已经满足
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:37.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.37,0:04:39.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会指示时机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.37,0:04:46.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,名叫田中爱之助的学生正准备去见犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:41.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:47.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你就是田中爱之助吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:50.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你把我弟弟怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:50.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:52.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别装傻！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:55.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我弟弟当时负责看着你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:58.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从那之后他就一直失踪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:05:00.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他在哪？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我弟弟……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:13.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是你用雕刻刀杀了他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:42.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.13,0:05:53.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.99,0:05:56.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我弟弟到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:05.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.65,0:06:09.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么重要的事……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:21.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.12,0:06:25.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我怎么会全忘了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:29.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我弟弟到底在哪？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:38.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被埋在临海地区 Sea Square大楼所在的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:49.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你弟弟……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:54.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被埋在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:14.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,动手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:15.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就是现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:48.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,池内和哉被逮捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:53.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,劫持巴士的犯人被捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:53.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你终于想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.65,0:08:00.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只有你一个人把它忘得一干二净 太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:08.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:14.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:18.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:25.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:29.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥变成那样……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:33.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是我的错……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.98,0:08:37.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,闭嘴！不准哭！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:39.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小学一年级的时候……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:40.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好好看着他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:43.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,……因为我自己不小心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:48.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,被两兄弟绑架了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:52.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:57.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,结果他也落入了犯人手中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:00.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.10,0:09:11.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你们父母死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:17.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他们急着筹赎金 结果被电车撞死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:23.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真是两个蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:28.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,孩子没救成 自己倒先死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:33.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:36.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说过你要是再敢出声 我就宰了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:01.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:04.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:06.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:08.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:14.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥为了保护我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:19.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,第一次杀了人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:28.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我把自己的亲哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:35.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,变成了杀人凶手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.76,0:10:37.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:04.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 把今天发生的事都忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:07.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,全都忘掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:13.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:39.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,田中爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:42.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏了你 我们才抓到了犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.85,0:11:46.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但关于你提到的杀人案 我们必须向你问话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:49.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,跟我们走一趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:51.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思 他今天太累了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请让他休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:56.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,带走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.43,0:11:57.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:11:59.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕就一天也好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:00.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.38,0:12:21.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,宫元先生 为什么要带我来这种地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:24.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我没打算对你做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:29.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只是不想让你再去妨碍梦人先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:31.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:38.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他除掉了福地警视 我才能坐上这个位子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:42.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以我非常感激梦人先生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:44.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.68,0:12:47.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是我哥哥的同伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:50.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:56.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你终于想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:03.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这段时间以来 只有我一个人背负着杀人的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:09.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,每次看到\N什么都不记得的你开心地笑着……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.84,0:13:15.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我都觉得自己快要发疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你能体会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:26.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,每天晚上 那个被杀的家伙都会出现在我梦里对我说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.28,0:13:32.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“杀人凶手 你休想开心过日子 ”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:35.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,每一天都是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.35,0:13:37.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你不觉得这很不公平吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:46.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既然如此……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.96,0:13:50.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么你的目标不是我？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:55.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是因为我 哥哥才会杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.89,0:14:00.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以就算你杀了我 我也毫无怨言
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:04.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.15,0:14:11.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正树和他妈妈是无辜的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.23,0:14:16.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,平先生的儿子也与这无关
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.69,0:14:21.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有在BLUE HEAVEN演唱会上受重伤的岛田
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:24.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有谷田部先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:31.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,みるく小姐也是无辜的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:42.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把无辜的人玩弄于股掌之中 绝对不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:50.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我……一定会阻止你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:56.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕赌上我的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:06.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,挺能说的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:09.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:13.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏了你 我的计划进入了最终阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:18.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你想起了埋尸的地点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:22.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也给了我挖掘那栋大楼的正当理由
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.89,0:15:27.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 哥哥 站住！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:29.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.62,0:16:08.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.35,0:16:10.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,炸弹？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:14.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:19.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,池内和哉案的调查进展如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:20.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:25.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,由于田中爱之助指认的地点已经建起了大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:30.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,特别小组应我们的要求制定了方案
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:36.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们会在Sea Square大楼旁挖一个30米深的坑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.16,0:16:42.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,随后横向挖掘至大楼正下方进行搜查
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.11,0:16:46.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我需要看清地下的情况 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.36,0:16:47.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.52,0:17:07.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.66,0:17:10.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不愧是专业人士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.93,0:17:32.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不愧是房东先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:51.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一切就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:25.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神山首相 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.03,0:18:30.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在东京……不 全日本都在我手上当人质
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:33.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:36.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我打算摧毁东京的一栋大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:42.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,里面放着维持东京运转的超级计算机
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:47.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一旦摧毁那栋大楼 整个东京的系统和网络都将陷入瘫痪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:49.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你明白这意味着什么吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:50.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神山首相
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.91,0:18:52.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,首相
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:59.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听到了吗？神山首相
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:02.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底想要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:06.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请把钱汇入我们的账户
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.99,0:19:09.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,金额是50万亿日元
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.16,0:19:13.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,50万亿？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:15.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那栋大楼戒备森严
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:18.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绝不可能被摧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.43,0:19:22.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就让我来证明我没有说谎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:37.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,首相！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:39.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,区政府大楼刚刚被炸毁了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:46.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来现在还是行不通啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:50.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我给你们考虑的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:54.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,限时5个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:56.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,静候佳音
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.29,0:20:05.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是Sea Square大楼的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.24,0:20:08.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多亏了你 我的计划进入了最终阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:11.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这应该就是关键线索
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.96,0:20:22.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:23.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.85,0:20:24.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:26.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.11,0:20:27.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:30.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有人给我出主意说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.36,0:20:36.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“只要拜托加藤刑警装上窃听器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.14,0:20:39.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就能听到很多有趣的事情 ”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:42.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢老师 还有加藤先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:45.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一开始还不信 但在狭山老师的软磨硬泡下照做了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:48.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,结果听到之后简直惊呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.15,0:20:50.10,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这么说 你们听到昨天说的话了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:52.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一字不漏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.97,0:20:57.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋……看我不好好收拾他
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:17.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 我有样东西要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:21.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是福地警视的记事本
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.99,0:21:28.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说不定你能从中找到什么线索
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.99,0:21:31.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,很遗憾我没能看出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.09,0:21:35.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但交给你或许能发现什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:46.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们兵分两路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:51.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我来争取时间 你们快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:52.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那加藤先生你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.82,0:21:54.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事的 快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.35,0:21:57.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,三 二 一 走！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:22:00.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 这边 这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.18,0:22:02.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:21.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.75,0:22:23.28,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这个……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:32.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我全都录下来了！宫元警视 你跟爱之助说的话 我全录下来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:41.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽说我只是个普通刑警 \N但我向来坚持伸张正义
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.54,0:22:45.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,绝不原谅你这种沦为罪犯走狗的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.94,0:23:05.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多米诺骨牌效应……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.78,0:23:12.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多米诺骨牌效应是指所有案件都环环相扣 还是说……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.73,0:23:20.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是……？！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.70,0:23:22.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.99,0:23:26.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.09,0:23:30.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我得先去一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.94,0:23:46.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好啊 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.30,0:23:51.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.84,0:23:59.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生 之前的爆炸案都是你干的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.14,0:24:03.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是被你发现了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.66,0:24:06.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来不想让你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.33,0:24:12.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真遗憾 我本来还想继续和你做朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.64,0:24:16.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在你又在策划下一场爆炸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.72,0:24:19.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,连这个你都知道了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.90,0:24:22.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.51,0:24:27.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,炸弹到底装在哪里？！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.25,0:24:31.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可是专业的 不能泄密
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.89,0:24:38.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过看在是你的份上 就告诉你一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.49,0:24:55.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.88,0:25:25.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,背叛者死
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.74,0:25:30.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 怎么这么慢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.44,0:25:32.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你得快点逃
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.34,0:25:33.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了 出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:36.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,房东先生被杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.03,0:25:37.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:41.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！我不想再逃避了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:48.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我决定了 绝不让你一个人去承担
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.69,0:25:55.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,明白了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.22,0:26:02.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对了 有件事想拜托你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.30,0:26:08.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.27,0:26:10.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.81,0:26:15.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我……要去见我哥
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.48,0:26:24.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太矮了 不是从这里看的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.51,0:26:30.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥在能看到那种景色的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.86,0:27:06.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,吉田人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.11,0:27:12.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,背叛者死 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.25,0:27:21.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真遗憾……他看不到这场好戏了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.61,0:27:34.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,神山首相
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.73,0:27:37.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,时间到了 你的答复是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.07,0:27:39.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们无法轻易答复
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.35,0:27:41.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还需要时间开会商议
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.17,0:27:42.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.95,0:27:44.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那真是太遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.57,0:27:47.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,游戏结束 永别了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.99,0:27:49.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等 先别挂……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.40,0:27:52.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们现在正在召开内阁会议……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.37,0:27:56.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么 这就挂了？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.75,0:27:59.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你还真够无情的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.85,0:28:03.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,本来还能再谈谈条件呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.34,0:28:07.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你很缺钱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.63,0:28:12.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,欣赏好戏可不需要钱
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:31.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,小老鼠也跟来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.99,0:28:42.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.66,0:28:48.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,收手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.99,0:28:51.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太迟了 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.29,0:28:59.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,既然你找来了这里 就代表你识破了我的计划吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.68,0:29:05.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,掌管东京系统运作的超级电脑所在的那栋大楼
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.63,0:29:10.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,安保极其严密 根本无从下手
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.18,0:29:12.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,多米诺骨牌效应
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.10,0:29:22.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你没法在那栋大楼直接安放炸弹 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.56,0:29:27.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,打算借由破坏其他大楼来炸毁它
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.93,0:29:29.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真能干 全让你猜中了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.63,0:29:30.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你还笑得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.04,0:29:34.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们兄弟俩的闹剧到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.84,0:29:45.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你对你弟弟太心软了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.73,0:29:49.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.27,0:30:03.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,典子小姐 就算你的枪法再好 \N空包弹也是杀不了我的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.78,0:30:14.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,忘了我做事向来周全吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.48,0:30:25.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“背叛者死” 你是这么说的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.02,0:30:30.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.03,0:30:50.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真不愧是田中梦人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.33,0:30:53.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过你高兴得太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.50,0:30:59.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在把枪交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.88,0:31:03.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.25,0:31:11.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来你真的背叛了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.14,0:31:25.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你终究还是没能对弟弟下手
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.42,0:31:29.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,舍弃不掉那点廉价的温情
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.14,0:31:34.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以我决定离开你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.72,0:31:42.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能活到最后的人才是赢家
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.68,0:31:48.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.20,0:31:53.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你确定吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.92,0:32:00.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说过我做事向来周全吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.92,0:32:05.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我装了自毁装置
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.84,0:32:08.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,自毁装置？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.40,0:32:13.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要你们开枪打死我 整栋大楼就会被炸上天
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:15.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,能活到最后的人才是赢家
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.49,0:32:18.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那么这场胜负就没有赢家了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.07,0:32:25.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀了我 大家一起死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.88,0:32:31.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.51,0:32:35.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要一起死在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.57,0:32:43.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你以为我和你共事多少年了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:48.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这种人绝不会选择自寻死路
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.43,0:32:50.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这不过是虚张声势！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.87,0:32:58.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这次要彻底了结你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.40,0:33:02.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.94,0:33:25.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.20,0:33:31.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那么 爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.51,0:33:39.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,最后的狂欢要开演了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.40,0:33:42.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.23,0:34:37.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么样 弟弟？很有趣吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.71,0:34:49.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 到底发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.79,0:34:51.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那些大楼会像多米诺骨牌一样接连倒塌
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:55.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果最后一栋大楼爆炸 东京就彻底完了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.19,0:34:58.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.71,0:34:59.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 那个呢……？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.85,0:35:01.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我带来了 但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.57,0:36:02.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,前一栋大楼会倒向那边 所以炸弹一定装在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.39,0:36:13.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 消防栓！\N- 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.94,0:36:15.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快找消防栓！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.40,0:36:17.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,消防栓……消防栓……
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.68,0:36:31.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.54,0:36:34.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.22,0:36:36.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.07,0:36:38.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.44,0:36:57.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要灌入液氮应该就能停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.08,0:37:12.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了 停下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.76,0:37:21.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.61,0:37:56.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.93,0:38:00.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.53,0:38:06.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.72,0:38:08.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,停下了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.04,0:38:10.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没错！我们阻止它了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.83,0:38:11.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.69,0:38:13.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.01,0:38:20.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然真的停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.04,0:38:30.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.99,0:38:36.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我必须过去一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.99,0:38:39.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.57,0:38:48.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥哥……我必须去救我哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.15,0:38:56.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.08,0:39:00.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但你要答应我
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.26,0:39:04.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,答应我一定要平安回来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.11,0:39:33.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.84,0:39:40.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.53,0:39:46.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这还用问吗？我是来送你去医院的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.63,0:39:51.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我要你活下去 为自己的罪孽赎罪
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.01,0:39:54.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.61,0:40:22.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 居然能阻止这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.94,0:40:26.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是多亏了这只左眼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.31,0:40:28.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,眼睛？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.07,0:40:37.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,移植给我的这只你的眼睛 \N一直在给我提示
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.33,0:40:45.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有它 我就无法阻止你了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.86,0:40:55.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我觉得 在你内心深处 \N其实也是渴望被阻止的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.48,0:41:05.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,正因如此 我的左眼才会看到你所看到的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.28,0:41:14.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你真是个笨蛋……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.23,0:41:18.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底为什么要……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.95,0:41:23.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,因为哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.26,0:41:28.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是我唯一的家人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.78,0:41:44.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要 怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.79,0:41:49.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.26,0:41:58.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.89,0:42:05.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.30,0:42:11.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.30,0:42:34.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,此时此刻听到我声音的各位……
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.70,0:42:38.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们有家人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.81,0:42:43.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我曾经也有过无比优秀的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.81,0:42:50.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,一位温柔 聪明又帅气的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.17,0:42:56.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,希望无论他身在何处 都能在天上注视着我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.98,0:43:01.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.36,0:43:04.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,该走啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.61,0:43:11.41,SongTop,,0,0,0,,即使眼中映出的世界满是悲伤
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.32,0:43:08.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.63,0:43:18.53,SongTop,,0,0,0,,我们的青春物语也绝不再逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.23,0:43:18.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,海风的气味……真是个舒服的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.63,0:43:26.47,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.86,0:43:21.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,みるく小姐能康复真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.87,0:43:23.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.47,0:43:27.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,跑起来吧 凛？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.57,0:43:34.32,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.42,0:43:41.71,SongTop,,0,0,0,,就算对未来感到不安 也不要敷衍逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.00,0:43:42.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 您已经回岗位工作了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.04,0:43:47.82,SongTop,,0,0,0,,不要对自己说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.88,0:43:47.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且精神百倍！宫元的处分已经定下来了 我总算安心了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.72,0:43:49.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.70,0:43:51.70,SongTop,,0,0,0,,纵然迷茫 迷茫 再迷茫 依然怀揣梦想 追逐梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.57,0:43:51.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实又接到了一个新案子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.76,0:44:01.75,SongTop,,0,0,0,,坚信这份心意终能传达 直到实现
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.79,0:44:00.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,私下跟你说 好像是一起密室杀人案……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.26,0:44:05.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,有传闻说 可能跟你哥哥有关
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.75,0:44:09.06,SongTop,,0,0,0,,凝视前方 我们一定能寻找到光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.90,0:44:07.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你能帮我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.81,0:44:10.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.06,0:44:14.31,SongTop,,0,0,0,,因为想看到泪水过后的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.05,0:44:15.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果又是哥哥策划的 我想我必须去解开它
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.31,0:44:23.43,SongTop,,0,0,0,,直到照亮 泪痕留下的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.41,0:44:17.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,真的吗 那太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.42,0:44:24.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现场有些古怪的地方 我还没太搞明白
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.44,0:44:32.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 我等下回给你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.07,0:44:35.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.34,0:44:36.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,来了……你的眼睛又？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.91,0:44:38.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.29,0:44:39.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这里可是墓地啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.43,0:44:41.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.19,0:44:45.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.55,0:44:49.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么躲开了？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.77,0:44:51.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,开个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.32,0:44:53.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起对不起 来吧 用全力打
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.98,0:44:55.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,耍我玩呢？
